{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n60.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thank the Lord, invoke His Name, proclaim His deeds among the peoples. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Sing to Him, play music to Him, tell of all His wonders. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Take pride in His holy Name; let the heart of those who seek the Lord, rejoice. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Search for the Lord and His strength, seek His countenance constantly. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Remember His wonders which He has performed, His signs and the judgments of His mouth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"O seed of His servant Israel, sons of Jacob His elect, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is the Lord our God, over the whole earth are His judgments. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/15","n":"15"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Remember for ever His "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:sic","attrs":{}}
{"text":"convenant"}
{"end":"t:sic"}
{"start":"t:corr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"covenant"}
{"end":"t:corr"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":", the word which He has commanded for thousands of generations, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/16","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"which He contracted with Abraham and swore to Isaac. "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n62.jpg","n":"16"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/17","n":"17"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He established it as Law for Jacob, for Israel as an eternal "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:sic","attrs":{}}
{"text":"convenant"}
{"end":"t:sic"}
{"start":"t:corr","attrs":{}}
{"text":"covenant"}
{"end":"t:corr"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":", "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/18","n":"18"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"saying: To you will I give the land of Canaan as the portion of your inheritance, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/19","n":"19"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"though you are small in number, few and strangers in it. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/20","n":"20"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"They wandered from nation to nation, from one kingdom to another people. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/21","n":"21"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He let no man oppress them and rebuked kings because of them. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/22","n":"22"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Do not touch my anointed ones, to my prophets do no harm. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/23","n":"23"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Sing to the Lord, all the earth, proclaim from day to day His salvation. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/24","n":"24"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Tell of His glory among the nations and among all peoples of His wonders. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/25","n":"25"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For great is the Lord and most renowned, and more awe-inspiring than all deities. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/26","n":"26"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"For all the deities of the peoples are idols — the Lord has made the heavens. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/27","n":"27"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Splendour and beauty are before Him, might and glory are in His place. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/28","n":"28"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Ascribe to the Lord, O families of the peoples, ascribe to the Lord honour and might. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/29","n":"29"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Ascribe to the Lord the glory of His Name, bring a gift and come before Him, bow before the Lord in sacred adornment. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/30","n":"30"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Tremble before Him, all the earth, though the world be firm and does not totter. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/31","n":"31"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let the heavens rejoice and the earth revel and among the nations let them say: The Lord reigns. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/32","n":"32"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Let the sea roar and the fullness of it, let the field and all that is in it be joyful. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/33","n":"33"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Then will trees of the forest exult before the Lord when He comes to judge the earth. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/34","n":"34"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Thank the Lord for He is good, for His grace endures for ever. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/35","n":"35"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"And say: Save us, God of our salvation, and gather us and deliver us from the nations, so that we may thank Thy holy Name and extol Thy fame. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:chronicles_1/16/36","n":"36"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Blessed be the Lord, the God of Israel, from eternity to eternity. And the whole people said Amen and praised the Lord. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
